    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "``pypy3`` [*options*] [``-c`` *cmd*\\ \\|\\ ``-m`` *mod*\\ \\|\\ *file.py*\\ \\|\\ ``-``\\ ] [*arg*\\ ...]",
      "source_hash": 2559694217715685952,
      "context_hash": 11991878700055306573,
      "translation": "``pypy3`` [*옵션*] [``-c`` *cmd*\\ \\|\\ ``-m`` *mod*\\ \\|\\ *file.py*\\ \\|\\ ``-``\\ ] [*인수*\\ ...]",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T05:07:27.963786Z",
      "issues": [
        "The markup and syntax are intact and \"옵션\"/\"인수\" are correct terms, but translating only some placeholders while leaving *cmd*, *mod*, and *file.py* in English is inconsistent (usually a command synopsis is either left entirely untranslated or has all its placeholders translated)."
      ]
