      "translation": "이 값이 설정되면 *stdin*/*stdout*/*stderr*\\ 에 사용되는 인코딩을 재정의합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T05:08:27.289449Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:10/seg:1",
      "source": "The syntax is *encodingname*:*errorhandler* The *errorhandler* part is optional and has the same meaning as in `str.encode`.",
      "source_hash": 7893203670892351335,
      "context_hash": 15925873663571563964,
      "translation": "구문은 *encodingname*:*errorhandler*\\ 입니다. *errorhandler* 부분은 선택 사항이며 `str.encode`\\ 에서와 같은 의미를 가집니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T05:08:27.289449Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:11/seg:0",
      "source": "``PYTHONNOUSERSITE``",
      "source_hash": 13644470830908547726,
      "context_hash": 2511794015621718145,
      "translation": "``PYTHONNOUSERSITE``",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-23T22:53:08.572840Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:12/seg:0",
      "source": "If set to a non-empty value, equivalent to the ``-s`` option.",
      "source_hash": 9218768164716680289,
      "context_hash": 14896089429376530621,
      "translation": "비어 있지 않은 값으로 설정하면 ``-s`` 옵션과 같습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T05:08:27.289718Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:12/seg:1",
      "source": "Don't add the user site directory to `sys.path`.",
      "source_hash": 1543286269525283888,
      "context_hash": 9897045448739548554,
      "translation": "사용자 사이트 디렉터리를 `sys.path`\\ 에 추가하지 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T05:08:27.289718Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:13/seg:0",
      "source": "``PYTHONWARNINGS``",
      "source_hash": 11935215365048968824,
      "context_hash": 10223757697652376624,
      "translation": "``PYTHONWARNINGS``",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-23T22:53:08.318746Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:14/seg:0",
      "source": "If set, equivalent to the ``-W`` option (warning control).",
      "source_hash": 7832460263008402358,
      "context_hash": 12346162148191048906,
      "translation": "설정하면 ``-W`` 옵션(경고 제어)과 같습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T05:08:27.290045Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:14/seg:1",
      "source": "The value should be a comma-separated list of ``-W`` parameters.",
      "source_hash": 6211741447396851663,
      "context_hash": 11324174604551191335,
      "translation": "값은 쉼표로 구분한 ``-W`` 매개변수 목록이어야 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T05:08:27.290045Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:15/seg:0",
      "source": "``PYPYLOG``",
      "source_hash": 4422373098837847875,
      "context_hash": 6737408769850271346,
      "translation": "``PYPYLOG``",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-23T22:53:17.080718Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:16/seg:0",
      "source": "If set to a non-empty value, enable logging, the format is:",
      "source_hash": 7365448695913086392,
      "context_hash": 10914684828341940484,
      "translation": "비어 있지 않은 값으로 설정하면 로깅이 활성화됩니다. 형식은 다음과 같습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T05:08:27.290346Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:17/seg:0",
      "source": "*fname* or *+fname*",
      "source_hash": 3601796537088342381,
      "context_hash": 13317357049313735559,
      "translation": "*fname* 또는 *+fname*",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-23T22:53:19.999332Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:18/seg:0",
      "source": "logging for profiling: includes all ``debug_start``/``debug_stop`` but not any nested ``debug_print``. *fname* can be ``-`` to log to *stderr*.",
      "source_hash": 17141681639526707406,
      "context_hash": 7743108355966982969,
      "translation": "프로파일링용 로깅: 모든 ``debug_start``/``debug_stop``\\ 을 포함하지만 중첩된 ``debug_print``\\ 는 포함하지 않습니다. *stderr*\\ 에 로그를 기록하려면 *fname*\\ 을 ``-``\\ 로 지정할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T05:08:27.290674Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:18/seg:1",
      "source": "The *+fname* form can be used if there is a *:* in fname",
      "source_hash": 13758958056692661616,
      "context_hash": 11492597405640737133,
      "translation": "fname에 *:*\\ 이 포함된 경우에는 *+fname* 형식을 사용할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T05:08:27.290675Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:19/seg:0",
      "source": "``:``\\ *fname*",
      "source_hash": 4311023426797624312,
      "context_hash": 17341029228138709868,
      "translation": "``:``\\ *fname*",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-23T22:53:27.265819Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:20/seg:0",
      "source": "Full logging, including ``debug_print``.",
      "source_hash": 5219205813798899664,
      "context_hash": 14799474000969645902,
      "translation": "``debug_print``\\ 를 포함한 전체 로깅입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-23T22:53:29.780322Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:21/seg:0",
      "source": "*prefix*\\ ``:``\\ *fname*",
      "source_hash": 4000607329576258276,
      "context_hash": 4434912648604720939,
      "translation": "*prefix*\\ ``:``\\ *fname*",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-23T22:53:29.893893Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:22/seg:0",
      "source": "Conditional logging.",
      "source_hash": 13850164645551264368,
      "context_hash": 14000607126454009128,
      "translation": "조건부 로깅입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T05:08:27.290937Z",
      "issues": [
        "The meaning is correct, but \"입니다\" turns the short noun phrase into a full sentence, which doesn't match the source's terse style; \"조건부 로깅.\" would fit better."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:22/seg:1",
      "source": "Multiple prefixes can be specified, comma-separated.",
      "source_hash": 2594564533671735718,
      "context_hash": 8232034086513971208,
      "translation": "여러 접두사를 쉼표로 구분하여 지정할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T05:08:27.290938Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:22/seg:2",
      "source": "Only sections whose name match the prefix will be logged.",
      "source_hash": 12516721199237563014,
      "context_hash": 6408677358161573787,
      "translation": "이름이 접두사와 일치하는 섹션만 로깅됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T05:08:27.290938Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:23/seg:0",
      "source": "``PYPYLOG=jit-log-opt,jit-backend:logfile`` will generate a log suitable for *jitviewer*, a tool for debugging performance issues under PyPy.",
      "source_hash": 12241057405542794397,
      "context_hash": 11878685539861883737,
      "translation": "``PYPYLOG=jit-log-opt,jit-backend:logfile``\\ 을 설정하면 PyPy의 성능 문제를 디버깅하는 도구인 *jitviewer*\\ 에 알맞은 로그가 생성됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "PyPy": "PyPy"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T05:08:27.291229Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:24/seg:0",
      "source": "``PYPY_IRC_TOPIC``",
      "source_hash": 13091035582600974673,
      "context_hash": 1883859767631451427,
      "translation": "``PYPY_IRC_TOPIC``",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-23T22:53:33.292446Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:25/seg:0",
      "source": "If set to a non-empty value, print a random #pypy IRC topic at startup of interactive mode.",
      "source_hash": 6101223806158410400,
      "context_hash": 17954228495372542364,
      "translation": "비어 있지 않은 값으로 설정하면 대화형 모드를 시작할 때 #pypy IRC 토픽 중 하나를 무작위로 골라 출력합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T05:08:27.291567Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "SEE ALSO",
      "source_hash": 4885026316160782284,
      "context_hash": 11386755326440057116,
      "translation": "참고 항목",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-25T05:08:27.291867Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
